DESCRIPTION:Bryan Callen is an actor\, comedian\, and podcaster. He is best
  known for his recurring role as “Coach Mellor” on ABC’s Schooled and
  The Goldbergs and as one of the original cast members of MadTV. Callen has
  also appeared in TV and films including Kingdom\, Hangover 1 & 2\, Ride Al
 ong\, Sex and the City\, Old School\, Entourage\, Californication\, and man
 y more.\n\nA veteran Headliner\, Callen performs in theaters and comedy ven
 ues across the world. His third one-hour comedy special\, “Complicated Ap
 es”\, topped the iTunes charts upon its release in March\, 2019 and can b
 e found on Amazon Prime.\n\nCallen is known for being the co-host of the to
 p-rated iTunes podcasts The Fighter and The Kid and Big & Hungry\, as well 
 as Conspiracy Social Club AKA Deep Waters\, which can be found on Patreon.\
 nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/bryan-callen-23459/
